OL,3,AMore than 20 children killed in DR
OL,4,ACongo school fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 24 schoolchildren have died in
OL,7,Fa stampede as they tried to flee a fire
OL,8,Fthat engulfed two schools in rebel-held
OL,9,FBukavu in the eastern Democratic
OL,10,FRepublic of Congo, officials there have
OL,11,Fsaid.
OL,13,FAdults are also reported to have died
OL,14,Fin the fire and there are fears that
OL,15,Fthe death toll could rise further in
OL,16,Fthe densely populated Kadutu commune.
OL,18,FSurvivors have been taken to nearby
OL,19,Fhospitals, and footage of the scene
OL,20,Fshows children lying on hospital floors
OL,21,Fin pain.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
